    "name": "Never Ending Nightmare",
    "steam_appid": 2485540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never Ending Nightmare</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game in the walking simulator genre. The average time to complete the game is 30 minutes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif.gif?t=1740792650\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark whose parents got into a terrible incident which led them both to die. You cope with your losses through reliving all the good memories you have had with them. But there is something off with all the memories this time... They are not how you <strong>remembered</strong> them at all. You don't truly want to know the truth behind this but there seems to be no other option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Mike's memories as a child and teenager.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with people and objects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> The game contains jumpscares.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never Ending Nightmare</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game in the walking simulator genre. The average time to complete the game is 30 minutes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif.gif?t=1740792650\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark whose parents got into a terrible incident which led them both to die. You cope with your losses through reliving all the good memories you have had with them. But there is something off with all the memories this time... They are not how you <strong>remembered</strong> them at all. You don't truly want to know the truth behind this but there seems to be no other option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Mike's memories as a child and teenager.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with people and objects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> The game contains jumpscares.</p>",
    "short_description": "Life has been tough for you after the tragic incident with your parents. Your way of coping has been through reliving all the good memories with them, but all the memories had a dark turn this time... will you be able to figure out why?",
